  "When the peer is one commit behind, the stick should hold that commit and its trees, not a second copy of every archived page.",
  "Multi-file edits show up together: a corrected caption, a renamed section, and a note filed under the same day.",
  "The full history remains available when someone asks for it, and only then.",
];

